  "title": "The African clawed frog (Xenopus laevis)",
  "part": 4,
  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 31–40</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Complete the notes. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">The African clawed frog (Xenopus laevis)</h4><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Description</div><div class=\"form-row \">Skin is <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"31\" id=\"q31\" name=\"q31\" placeholder=\"31\" aria-label=\"Question 31\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> and can vary in colour</div><div class=\"form-row \">Skin is coated with a slippery film for <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"32\" id=\"q32\" name=\"q32\" placeholder=\"32\" aria-label=\"Question 32\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Males are <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"33\" id=\"q33\" name=\"q33\" placeholder=\"33\" aria-label=\"Question 33\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> the size of females</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Habitat</div><div class=\"form-row \">Native to Africa</div><div class=\"form-row \">Live in fresh water-prefer water that is <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"34\" id=\"q34\" name=\"q34\" placeholder=\"34\" aria-label=\"Question 34\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Can survive high levels of <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"35\" id=\"q35\" name=\"q35\" placeholder=\"35\" aria-label=\"Question 35\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> in water</div><div class=\"form-row \">Cannot survive if there is any metal in the water</div><div class=\"form-row \">In drought conditions, may live in <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"36\" id=\"q36\" name=\"q36\" placeholder=\"36\" aria-label=\"Question 36\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> for up to a year</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Diet</div><div class=\"form-row \">Eat living or dead water creatures</div><div class=\"form-row \">Find food using their sense of <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"37\" id=\"q37\" name=\"q37\" placeholder=\"37\" aria-label=\"Question 37\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\">, their fingers, and their lateral lines</div><div class=\"form-row \">Take food into their mouths using front legs and a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"38\" id=\"q38\" name=\"q38\" placeholder=\"38\" aria-label=\"Question 38\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> system</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Other information</div><div class=\"form-row \">Now popular as a pet in the US</div><div class=\"form-row \">In some US states they are identified as a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"39\" id=\"q39\" name=\"q39\" placeholder=\"39\" aria-label=\"Question 39\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Used in laboratories for developmental research</div><div class=\"form-row \">Mucus from the skin has <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"40\" id=\"q40\" name=\"q40\" placeholder=\"40\" aria-label=\"Question 40\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> properties</div></div>",
